Ladybird resolves legacy writing modes before pairing a logical margin
with its physical side during cascade rollback. Chrome 158.0.8127.36,
Firefox 151.0 and WebKit 26.5 all restored the earlier layer’s 7px
margin in both directions for all six aliases. Blink maps the keywords
in CssValueIDToPlatformEnum() and rolls back in ResolveRevertLayer().
Gecko declares the aliases on WritingModeProperty. WebKit accepts the
legacy values in its writing-mode descriptor in CSSProperties.json.
